      "content": "For our 22 zebrafish heart-regeneration samples we'd like each transcription factor's activity in each sample, separate from its own mRNA level, together with signed activating or repressing effects of each TF on its target genes. We have the expression matrix, a TF-by-gene motif prior and a TF-TF PPI matrix. The project started as a side analysis of an old microarray study."
    },
